Subject: [PATCH] Documentation: numerical type, AMD GPU

The installation guide describes the numerical type of mfem-mgis, the one
of MFEM (float when MFEM is compiled in single precision): MGIS of the
same type, AmgX refused, type exported and given to mfront, parameters
kept in double, relative tolerances of the solvers bounded, floors of the
residuals with float. The page tells that mfem-mgis has been run on an
integrated AMD GPU, and how to avoid the kernels lost by its runtime.
